text PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_Intro {
    "I am BRUNO of the ELITE FOUR!\p"
    "Through rigorous training, people\n"
    "and POKéMON can become stronger\l"
    "without limit.\p"
    "I've lived and trained with my\n"
    "fighting POKéMON!\l"
    "And that will never change!\p"
    "{PLAYER}!\p"
    "We will grind you down with our\n"
    "superior power!\p"
    "Hoo hah!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"
}

